  "rule_flags": [],
  "narration": "Old Men squints at the player, his weathered hands resting on the bar. He leans back in his stool, the creak of the wooden floorboards joining his words.",
  "npc_response": "Trouble follows the unwary, stranger. The Port Tavern's a fine house, but it's full of men who've been there too long and know too much. Keep your head down, mind your coin, and never let anyone talk you into a debt you can't pay. The harbour guild don't care about your reasons — they only care about the crowns. Stay out of their way, and you'll be fine."
}

