  "narration": "Vorn the Mad spins slowly on his stool, his eyes darting toward the shifting starmap on the wall. A faint green glow pulses in his left eye. He leans forward, voice dropping to a conspiratorial whisper before suddenly shouting, 'You ask about me? You ask about the man who built this room with his own trembling hands? You think I am the monster in the jars? The monster is not in the jars, wanderer. The monster is the silence between your questions.'",
